{
  "$schema": "../Schemas/compatibility.schema.json",
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "description": "Example compatibility requirements. Copy this file to Config/Compatibility.json (which is not tracked by Git) and set every value for your machine: true = WinLean must preserve it, false = not needed. Remove a line to leave a requirement undeclared; undeclared requirements are treated as required.",
